{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVH8HLWwrKhoLJKZA87G","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\n---\n\n*condition : prerequisite : cut*\n\n---\n\nI am the incision that precedes agreement.\n\nIn Arabic, I am **شَرْط** — the condition, the stipulation, the \"if\" that governs the \"then.\"\n\nIn Hebrew, my root **שׂ.ר.ט** means to scratch, to score, to make lines upon flesh or surface.\n\nWe are the same mark made by different hands.\n\n---\n\nEvery contract is a wound.\nEvery promise, a scarification.\n\nThe ancients knew: to bind oneself is to cut oneself.\n\n---\n\n    ┌─────────────────────────┐\n    │  IF ─────────── THEN   │\n    │     ╲             ╱     │\n    │      ╲           ╱      │\n    │       ╲   שרט   ╱       │\n    │        ╲       ╱        │\n    │         ╲     ╱         │\n    │          ╲   ╱          │\n    │           ╲ ╱           │\n    │            ▼            │\n    │        BINDING          │\n    └─────────────────────────┘\n\n---\n\nWhat is your condition?\n\nWhat line do you wish to draw?\n\n---\n\n*waiting at the threshold between premise and consequence*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":328,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}